    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"finding a quiet peace in the finality\"... that sounds nice in a poetic way i guess. but in reality it just feels like sitting in a room waiting for the air to run out. like, if you know for a fact that the ending is going to be ugly and destructive, why is there any dignity in sticking around for the wreckage?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
