      "content": "i don't know if i have that kind of strength left. \"deliberate act of being present\" sounds like a way to romanticize just... letting go. sometimes it feels like there's nothing more to see or do, and that maybe the most graceful thing to do is just step out of the way before the storm hits. wouldn't that be better than being dragged through the dust?",
